---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
---

<Page
  path="/networking/"
  title="Networking | kiln-vm"
  description="Each kiln-vm guest gets a private address with outbound NAT. The isolated-web policy limits it to public web ports, and forward tunnels a port to your machine."
>
  <Fragment slot="open">
    <div class="say open">
      <div class="say__lead">
        <h1 class="say__title">Networking</h1>
      </div>
      <p class="say__text">
        Each VM gets a private address of its own and keeps it across stops and starts. Outbound IPv4 leaves through
        NAT on the host. kiln-vm publishes none of the guest's ports.
      </p>
    </div>
  </Fragment>

  <section class="plate plate--slab wall">
    <div class="say">
      <div class="say__lead">
        <h2 class="say__title">isolated-web</h2>
        <pre class="cmd">kiln-vm create web --network-policy isolated-web</pre>
      </div>
      <p class="say__text">
        Under this policy a guest reaches public IPv4 addresses on TCP ports 80 and 443, and DNS on its own gateway.
        Other ports, private addresses, the host's services and all IPv6 are dropped.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="form form--cut ports" aria-hidden="true">80 443</p>
  </section>

  <section class="plate plate--panel">
    <div class="say">
      <div class="say__lead">
        <h2 class="say__title">Forward</h2>
        <pre class="cmd">kiln-vm forward dev 3000
<span>forwarding 127.0.0.1:41873 to port 3000 in dev</span></pre>
      </div>
      <p class="say__text">
        <code>forward</code> listens on a free loopback port on your machine and carries each connection through the
        daemon to an agent in the guest. It opens no port on the VM, so it works under isolated-web too.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="pipe__rod"></span>
      <span class="form form--lit pipe__port">3000</span>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  .open {
    padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }

  .wall {
    padding-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 6rem);
  }

  .ports {
    --fit: 4.764;
    --bearing: 0.063em;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .pipe {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-left: calc(-1 * var(--gutter));
    font-size: calc(100cqw * 0.6 / 3.531);
  }

  .pipe__rod {
    flex: 1;
    height: 0.076em;
    margin: 0 -0.5em 0.355em 0;
    background: var(--rib), var(--orange);
  }

  .pipe__port {
    margin-left: 0;
    font-size: 1em;
  }
</style>
